<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Dec 16.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Dec 16.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some Australian stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>*Highlands Gold Ltd A$.76 (unch)</p>
<p>Highlands said late on Friday it would take legal action in Australia and Papua New Guinea if hostile bidder Placer Dome Inc did not amend alleged defects in its offer documents.</p>
<p>*News Corp Ltd A$6.43 (-.12)</p>
<p>News Corp Vice-president of finance and banking William Sorenson said he expected the media group to post US$800 million cash flow in 1996 after interest capital expenditures and taxes.</p>
<p>*Aerodata Holdings Ltd A$1.08 (+.01)</p>
<p>Aerodata announces on Friday that it would buy 20 percent of UK firm Scott Pickford Plc, in turn the British group would buy 4.3 percent of Aerodata.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
